{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19196","headline":"自左冯归洛下酬乐天兼呈裴令公 · 刘禹锡","name":"自左冯归洛下酬乐天兼呈裴令公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新恩通籍在龙楼，分务神都近旧丘。\n自有园公紫芝侣，仍追少傅赤松游。\n华林霜叶红霞晚，伊水晴光碧玉秋。\n更接东山文酒会，始知江左未风流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}